<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Village Road year net profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Village Road year net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    71.31 vs 53.34</p>
<p>    Net				     47.49 vs 38.00</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     8.5  vs 7.00</p>
<p>NOTE: Village Roadshow Ltd is a cinema and theme park operator.  </p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	    8.5 vs 7.0</p>
<p>Dividend is unfranked</p>
<p>Reg date Oct 25</p>
<p>Pay date Nov 20</p>
<p>    Sales				297.12 vs 246.62</p>
<p>    Other income		     104.49 vs 125.73</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			 17.29 vs 14.23</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Tax				    6.61 vs 10.39</p>
<p>    Interest			    12.02 vs 11.94</p>
<p>    Depreciation			46.94 vs 24.11</p>
